        <body>
            <div xml:id="sources">

                <pb facs="0011" n="XI" xml:id="pgXI"/>

                <head>List of Sources</head>
                <p rendition="#center #center"><hi rendition="#bold">Unpublished Sources</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Department of State</hi>
                        <list>
                            <label>1.</label>
                            <item>Indexed Central Files. A major source of documentation for this
                                volume was the indexed central (decimal) files of the Department of
                                State.</item>
                            <label>2.</label>
                            <item>Lot Files. Documents from the central files have been supplemented
                                by materials from decentralized office files, the lot files of the
                                Department of State. A list of the lot files consulted in this
                                volume follows: <list>
                                    <item>Conference Files: Lot 65 D 533 <list>
                                            <item>Collection of documentation on official visits by
                                                heads of government and foreign ministers to the
                                                United States and on major international conferences
                                                attended by the Secretary of State for 1962 as
                                                maintained by the Executive Secretariat of the
                                                Department of State.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>Presidential Correspondence: Lot 66 D 476 <list>
                                            <item>Correspondence of the President with various heads
                                                of state, 1961-1966.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>S/P Files: Lot 69 D 121 <list>
                                            <item>Subject files, country files, chronological files,
                                                documents, drafts, and related correspondence of the
                                                Policy Planning Staff for 1962.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>S/S Files: Lot 66 D 219 <list>
                                            <item>Briefing books and chronologies as maintained by
                                                the Executive Secretariat, 1962-1965.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>S/S-NSC Files: Lot 72 D 316 <list>
                                            <item>Master file of National Security Action Memoranda
                                                (NSAMs), 1961-1968.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>Secretaryʼs Memoranda of Conversation: Lot 65 D 330 <list>
                                            <item>Memoranda of the Secretary of Stateʼs and Under
                                                Secretary of Stateʼs conversations,
                                                1961-1964.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>Vietnam Working Group Files: Lot 66 D 193 <list>
                                            <item>Files of the Vietnam Working Group,
                                                1960-1962.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>Vietnam Working Group Files: Lot 66 D 307 <list>
                                            <item>Master files of the Vietnam Working Group for
                                                1962.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                </list></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <pb facs="0012" n="XII" xml:id="pgXII"/>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Washington National Records Center, Suitland,
                            Maryland</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#bold">Record Group 84, Records of Foreign Service
                                    Posts of the United States</hi>
                                <list>
                                    <item>Saigon Embassy Files: FRC 67 A 677 <list>
                                            <item>Classified files of the Embassy in Saigon for
                                                1962.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>Saigon Embassy Files: FRC 68 A 5159 <list>
                                            <item>Top Secret files of the Embassy in Saigon,
                                                1955-1964, formerly Lot 66 F 89.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#bold">Record Group 306, Records of the U.S.
                                    Information Agency</hi>
                                <list>
                                    <item>USIA/I/S Files: FRC 68 A 4933 <list>
                                            <item>U.S. Information Agency subject files for the Far
                                                East.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>USIA/IAF Files: FRC 68 A 1415 <list>
                                            <item>Files of the Office of the Director of the U.S.
                                                Information Agency, 1961-1962; action copies
                                                retained by the Assistant Director for the Far
                                                East.1963-1964.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#bold">Record Group 330, Records of the Offlce of
                                    the Secretary of Defense</hi>
                                <list>
                                    <item>OASD/ISA Files: FRC 69 A 3501 <list>
                                            <item>General and country files of the Assistant
                                                Secretary of Defense for International Security
                                                Affairs for 1962.</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item>OSD Files: FRC 66 A 3542 <list>
                                            <item>Records of the Secretary and Deputy Secretary of
                                                Defense and their Special Assistants for 1962</item>
                                        </list></item>
                                </list></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">John F. Kennedy Library, Boston, Massachusetts</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>National Security Files (NSF) <list>
                                    <item>Brornley Smith Series.</item>
                                    <item>Departments and Agendes Series.</item>
                                    <item>Meetings and Memos Series.</item>
                                    <item>Vietnam Country Series.</item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item>Presidentʼs Office Files</item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Library of Congress, Washington, D.C.</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>Harriman Papers, Vietnam</item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">National Defense University, Washington, D.C.</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>Taylor Papers <list>
                                    <item>Papers of General Maxwell D. Taylor, Chief of Staff of the
                                        Army, 1955-1959 Military Adviser to the President,
                                        1961-1962; Chairman of the Joint Chief of Staff
                                        1962-1964.</item>
                                </list></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <pb facs="0013" n="XIII" xml:id="pgXIII"/>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Naval Historical Center, Washington, D.C.</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>Burke Papers <list>
                                    <item>Papers of Admiral Arleigh A. Burke, Chief of Naval
                                        Operations, 1955-1961.</item>
                                </list></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">University of Montana, Missoula, Montana</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>Mansfield Papers</item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Yale University, New Haven, Connecticut</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>Bowles Papers</item>
                        </list></item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#center #center"><hi rendition="#bold">Published Sources</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Documentary Collections and Periodicals</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#italic">The Declassified Documents Quarterly
                                    Catalog, 1977</hi>. Washington: Carrollton Press, Inc.,
                                1977.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#italic">The Declassified Documents Quarterly
                                    Catalog, 1978</hi>. Washington: Carrollton Press, Inc.,
                                1978.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#italic">The Declassified Documents Quarterly
                                    Catalog, 1981</hi>. Washington: Carrollton Press, Inc.,
                                1981.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#italic">The Pentagon Papers: The Defense
                                    Department History of United States Decisionmaking on
                                    Vietnam</hi> [The Senator Gravel Edition], 4 vols. Boston:
                                Beacon Press, 1971.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the Presidents of the
                                    United States: John F. Kennedy, 1962</hi>. Washington.: U.S.
                                Government Printing Office, 1963.</item>
                            <item>U.S. Department of Defense. <hi rendition="#italic">United
                                    States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi> [The Pentagon Papers],
                                12 vols. Washington: U.S. Government Printing Office, 1971.</item>
                            <item>U.S. Department of State. <hi rendition="#italic">American Foreign
                                    Policy: Current Documents, 1962</hi>. Washington: U.S.
                                Government Printing Office, 1966.</item>
                            <item>———. Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>,
                                1962. Washington: U.S. Government Printing Office.1962.</item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">Memoirs</hi>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Note</hi>: The following memoirs were consulted
                            at the time this volume was prepared in 1984. The Department takes no
                            responsibility for their accuracy nor endorses their interpretation of
                            the events.</p>
                        <list>
                            <item>Galbraith, John Kenneth. <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassadorʼs
                                    Journal: A Personal Account of the Kennedy Years</hi>. Boston:
                                Houghton Mifflin Co., 1969.</item>
                            <item>Hilsman, Roger. <hi rendition="#italic">To Move a Nation</hi>.
                                Garden City, N.Y.: Doubleday, 1967.</item>
                            <item>Mecklin, John. <hi rendition="#italic">Mission in Torment</hi>.
                                Garden City, N.Y: Doubleday, 1965.</item>
                            <item>Taylor, Maxwell D. <hi rendition="#italic">Swords and
                                    Plowshares</hi>. New York: W.W. Norton, 1972.</item>
                        </list></item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
